{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are not a distant ruler.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Kingdom Conquer</strong>, you lead a growing Norse clan from a handful of survivors into a thriving kingdom built entirely by your own hands:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place every building.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command every villager.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight every battle yourself.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Realm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/120177ce4a296a703e197b0b96c87f2e.poster.avif?t=1774497194\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/120177ce4a296a703e197b0b96c87f2e.webm?t=1774497194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/120177ce4a296a703e197b0b96c87f2e.mp4?t=1774497194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand tile-by-tile across a seamless, persistent world.<br>Establish settlements, resource outposts, defences and industry to support your people and fuel your war effort.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live Among Your People</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/74e2514b59afc4d2df6c2bbf591a7c81.poster.avif?t=1774497194\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/74e2514b59afc4d2df6c2bbf591a7c81.webm?t=1774497194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/74e2514b59afc4d2df6c2bbf591a7c81.mp4?t=1774497194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your settlers are not background units, they live beside you.<br>Assign roles, give orders in real time, and watch your society function around you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight For The Land</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/b6ab54e5367026f2f3b33c3d5f36ba66.poster.avif?t=1774497194\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/b6ab54e5367026f2f3b33c3d5f36ba66.webm?t=1774497194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/b6ab54e5367026f2f3b33c3d5f36ba66.mp4?t=1774497194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When war comes, you're right there in the fight.<br>Lead charges, defend raids, and invade rival territories to secure your future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Living World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/79fcbede90107c981181e76bac455312.poster.avif?t=1774497194\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/79fcbede90107c981181e76bac455312.webm?t=1774497194\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/extras/79fcbede90107c981181e76bac455312.mp4?t=1774497194\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive, procedurally generated land where every tile can be explored, conquered and reshaped.<br>As your borders expand so too does your economy, military strength and influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832210?t=1774497194","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832210?t=1774497194","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/dbac5a9ffb35912ca73bb23d1736906851286969/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774497194","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832210/dbac5a9ffb35912ca73bb23d1736906851286969/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774497194","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Animals are carved into chunks to collect food in a cartoonish and not realistic manner.\r\n\r\nHumans fight in close combat and ragdoll upon death."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4330310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are not a distant ruler.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Kingdom Conquer</strong>, you lead a growing Norse clan from a handful of survivors into a thriving kingdom built entirely by your own hands:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place every building.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command every villager.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight every battle yourself.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Realm</h2><p class=\"